56.6929133858267775 623.6222834645668627 Td
(1. Dual-Rail Spot Trading & Swaps: Spot trades and swaps are executed on Coinbase Prime API and Kraken OTC.) Tj
T* (Swaps are processed as atomic double-leg orders. The second leg order size is dynamically computed from live) Tj
T* (price feed quotes of the sold asset, ensuring exact fiat-to-crypto sizing without validation failures.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.216 0.255 0.318 rg
56.6929133858267775 569.7640157480313974 Td
(2. Hardened On-Chain Crypto Transfers: The /api/coinbase/send endpoint executes secure transfers. The) Tj
T* (response payload returns the exact target destination address \(to: targetAddress\) rather than unassigned variables.) Tj
T* (Outgoing transfers correctly subtract from the operator available ledger balance.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.216 0.255 0.318 rg
56.6929133858267775 515.9057480314959321 Td
(3. Direct Bank Cleared Deposits & Withdrawals: The terminal routes fiat transfers \(e.g. Tangerine OAuth Interac) Tj
T* (flows\). Ledgers classify bank deposits as RECEIVE entries and bank withdrawals as SEND entries, preventing) Tj
T* (reverse-mapping bugs in the UI.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.216 0.255 0.318 rg
56.6929133858267775 462.0474803149605805 Td
(4. Self-Healing Watchdog Daemon: An asynchronous reconciliation daemon actively checks database rows against) Tj
T* (the master ledger database. If drift is detected, it auto-initiates a Global Re-Index to realign database states with) Tj
T* (truth consensus.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.216 0.255 0.318 rg
56.6929133858267775 408.1892125984251152 Td
(5. Dual-Channel Alert Pipelines: Dispatches transaction alerts and verification challenges via Nodemailer SMTP) Tj
T* (servers and MailerSend APIs, ensuring multi-factor challenges are verified before high-value disbursements.) Tj
ET
